0..73 Comment "// A cost bound below a run\'s count, which is refused `EndpointMismatch`."
74..76 Comment "//"
77..149 Comment "// A bound is a program, so a bound that does not hold is refused by the"
150..191 Comment "// conversion that settles one that does."
192..194 Comment "//"
195..267 Comment "// The checker runs the steps under `Counting`, counts three and reaches"
268..341 Comment "// `false` from `Count.le` at two. No conversion takes `false` to `true`."
342..344 Comment "//"
345..415 Comment "// - see: `ledger/features/cost-effect.gandr` — the bound that holds"
416..493 Comment "// - see: `../../../library/std/src/cost.gandr` — `Cost.Eff` and `Counting`"
494..553 Comment "// - see: #2288 — decalf\'s cost effect as a lawful theory"
